  <h2>Which test to choose</h2>
  <p>Choose <strong>NS1</strong> for early presentation (≤7 days of fever); choose <strong>IgM/IgG</strong> for later or convalescent presentation; choose a <strong>combined NS1+IgM/IgG</strong> device when timing is unknown — it covers the widest window in one test.</p>

